        <mxCell id="_TAalcuWt3JU3wAnrQ1j-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;How It Works Together in Top-Down&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;When you open a completed Top-Down Service Map in ServiceNow, you are looking at both dimensions working at the same time:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Horizontal Layer (Process-to-Process):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 32px; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3bd2db5199460e73-113&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Service Mapping starts at your Entry Point (e.g., &lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;[https://sap.tcs](https://sap.tcs)...&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;   &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3bd2db5199460e73-114&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;It maps: Entry Point ➔ Load Balancer ➔ Apache Web Process ➔ Tomcat App Process ➔ Oracle DB Instance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !importan