        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_TAalcuWt3JU3wAnrQ1j-16" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div class=&quot;ZLzG0d ncoeY E8xBUb&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;📊 The Core Components of CSDM&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;The Model:&lt;/strong&gt; A blueprint of standard CMDB tables and relationships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;The Data:&lt;/strong&gt; The actual records you populate (servers, applications, services).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;The Framework:&lt;/strong&gt; A crawl-walk-run-fly guidance map for building out your IT data model sequentially.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(232, 234, 242);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;AHmQrc&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &am